{"slug":"php-online-training","id":"4604","title":"PHP Online Training","description":"<h3>About PHP Online Training:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>PHP Online Training may be a widely-used general-purpose scripting language that’s especially fitted to Web development and may be embedded into HTML.</li>\n<li>PHP can generate dynamic page content</li>\n<li>PHP can create, open, read, write, and close files on the server</li>\n<li>PHP can collect form data</li>\n<li>PHP can send and receive cookies</li>\n<li>PHP can add, delete, modify data in your database</li>\n<li>PHP can restrict users to access some pages on your website</li>\n<li>PHP can encrypt data</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With PHP you are not limited to output HTML. You can output images, PDF files, and even Flash movies. You can also output any text, such as XHTML and XML.</p>\n<h3><strong> </strong>Prerequisites:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>HTML</li>\n<li>CSS</li>\n<li>JavaScript</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Terms And Conditions:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","curriculumInfo":"2 Sections22 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"77","title":"PHP Online Training Course Content:","count":"1","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"4606","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/php-online-training/lessons/an-introduction-to-php/","number":"2.1","title":"An Introduction To PHP","status":"locked"}]},{"id":"78","title":"PHP Basics","count":"21","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"4608","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/php-online-training/lessons/default-syntax/","number":"3.1","title":"Default Syntax","status":"locked"},{"id":"4610","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/php-online-training/lessons/variables-in-php/","number":"3.2","ti